1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,330
Working on the Production board?

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:04,169
Which collabs need you today?

3
00:00:04,519 --> 00:00:05,904
Late ones. Due ones.

4
00:00:05,754 --> 00:00:07,303
Creators gone quiet.

5
00:00:07,153 --> 00:00:08,868
All buried in one board,

6
00:00:08,718 --> 00:00:10,515
across hundreds of rows.

7
00:00:10,865 --> 00:00:13,478
Collab Digest. The easiest way to see

8
00:00:13,328 --> 00:00:14,152
what needs you.

9
00:00:14,502 --> 00:00:16,677
Sign in with your company Google account.

10
00:00:17,008 --> 00:00:18,744
Paste your Monday token once.

11
00:00:19,016 --> 00:00:21,186
You only see collabs where you are

12
00:00:21,036 --> 00:00:21,620
the CFS.

13
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:25,356
The digest sorts everything into three groups.

14
00:00:25,206 --> 00:00:26,684
Needs you. Due today.

15
00:00:26,534 --> 00:00:28,759
Late. Every row shows the stage,

16
00:00:28,609 --> 00:00:31,166
the deadline, and the latest update.

17
00:00:31,516 --> 00:00:33,212
Open a row to read the latest

18
00:00:33,062 --> 00:00:34,995
comments, and see who posted them.

19
00:00:35,401 --> 00:00:36,763
No hunting through Monday.

20
00:00:37,113 --> 00:00:38,774
Every weekday at 7:30,

21
00:00:38,919 --> 00:00:40,557
a briefing lands in Slack,

22
00:00:40,758 --> 00:00:42,563
with your counts and your top three

23
00:00:42,413 --> 00:00:42,962
collabs.

24
00:00:43,312 --> 00:00:45,941
The KPI page shows how you're really

25
00:00:45,791 --> 00:00:47,223
doing. On-time rate,

26
00:00:47,073 --> 00:00:49,104
cycle time, and what's stuck.

27
00:00:49,454 --> 00:00:51,444
Creators shows who has gone quiet.

28
00:00:51,804 --> 00:00:53,579
After five days with no post,

29
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:54,769
they get a Quiet tag.

30
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:57,355
Then Messages fills in the nudge for

31
00:00:57,205 --> 00:00:58,189
you. Their name,

32
00:00:58,039 --> 00:00:59,857
their collab, their deadline.

33
00:00:59,707 --> 00:01:00,761
Copy it, and send.

34
00:01:01,111 --> 00:01:03,159
Need to update several collabs?

35
00:01:03,009 --> 00:01:04,619
Post update writes once,

36
00:01:04,469 --> 00:01:05,860
and posts on each one,

37
00:01:05,710 --> 00:01:06,809
under your name.

38
00:01:06,659 --> 00:01:07,904
You confirm first.

39
00:01:08,254 --> 00:01:10,203
Collab status, without the scrolling.

40
00:01:10,553 --> 00:01:13,446
Collab Digest. Start every day knowing what

41
00:01:13,296 --> 00:01:13,887
needs you.
